msgid "Markdown for AI agents"
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/markdown-for-agents.rst:4
msgid ""
"Read the Docs serves a Markdown version of documentation pages to clients"
" that request it, using HTTP content negotiation. Markdown is smaller and"
" easier to parse than rendered HTML, which makes it a better format for "
"AI agents and language models to consume."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/markdown-for-agents.rst:9
msgid ""
"This feature is **enabled automatically** on all documentation domains "
"hosted on Read the Docs, with no configuration required. Browsers "
"continue to receive the regular HTML version of your documentation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/markdown-for-agents.rst:13
msgid "A request with ``Accept: text/markdown`` returns a Markdown response:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/markdown-for-agents.rst:31
msgid ""
